       {
        "tex": "\\overline{2 - i} &= 2 + i"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "title": "Find the quadratic factor from the pair",
      "lines": [
       {
        "text": "Sum of the pair, then product of the pair."
       },
       {
        "tex": "(2 - i) + (2 + i) &= 4"
       },
       {
        "tex": "(2 - i)(2 + i) &= 4 - i^2 = 5"
       },
       {
        "text": "So the quadratic factor is $z^2 - 4z + 5$."
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "title": "Divide to find the linear factor",
