     },
     {
      "title": "Assume the result is true for n = k",
      "lines": [
       {
        "tex": "(\\cos\\theta - i\\sin\\theta)^k &= \\cos k\\theta - i\\sin k\\theta"
       },
       {
        "text": "This is $P(k)$. We now test $P(k+1)$."
